message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below. — 연구에서 이 소프트웨어를 사용했다면 아래와 같이 인용해 주세요."
title: "Anchor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kang"
    given-names: "Julgi"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/julgi80ai-stack/anchor-mcp"
version: 1.14.0
date-released: "2026-08-20"
abstract: >-
  A temporal and provenance integrity layer for the web evidence AI relies on:
  a local-first fetch cache with citation anchoring and re-verification,
  implemented as a local client of Memento (RFC 7089).
keywords:
  - reference rot
  - citation drift
  - memento
  - rfc7089
  - web archiving
  - provenance
  - model context protocol
